    9----  ****************** CONTROL SECTION                                             
   10----   'Soil1'      Name of this soil profile, max 10 characters                     
   11----   1.0     CONFRC    Old-force-unit  = CONFRC * New-force-unit  1MN  = 1000*1KN  
   12----   1.0     CONLTH    Old-length-unit = CONLTH * New-length-unit  1M  = 3.28*1FT  
   13----   1       NUMLAYM   Number of main soil layers (max is 1000)                    
   14----   0       NUMDSP    Number of Z-levels with given soil displacements (max is 50)
   15----   10.0    GAMMAW    Unit weight of water (10.0 kN/m3 in SI-units)               
   16----   101.3   ATMPRS    Atmospheric pressure (101.3 kN/m2 in SI-units)              
   17----   0.00       ZCYCL     Z-level down to which cyclic P-Y data shall be generated 
   18----   96   SUSTIF    Use stiff clay P-Y procedures if Su.GT.SUSTIF (API only)       
   19----   2       JPRINT    Printed output code (0=None 1=Some 2=Full)                  
   20----   1       JECHO     Echo print of input file NF14 to file NF16 (0=No 1=Yes)     
   21----                                                                                 
   22----  ****************** MATERIAL COEFFICIENTS SECTION                               
   23----   1.000   SFTPHI    Material coefficient on tan(phi)                            
   24----   1.000   SFSU      Material coefficient on undrained shear strength            
   25----   1.000   SFSKF     Material coefficient on pile skin friction                  
   26----   1.000   SFSIGT    Material coefficient on pile tip resistance                 
   27----                                                                                 
   28----  ****************** PILE DIAMETERS AND GROUP EFFECTS SECTION                    
   29----   1       NUMDIA    Number of pile diam for which P-Y/T-Z/Q-Z data is wanted (ma
   30----   1.000             'NUMDIA' pile diameters in increasing order                 
   31----   0       ESOL0     E-soil for lateral group effect calc: Eh(Z)=ESOL0+ESOL1*Z   
   32----   0       ESOL1     ESOL0 = Eh-soil at Z=0.0 , ESOL1 = dEh/dZ , Z = Z-coord     
   33----   1.0       EVHRAT    Ratio Ev(Z)/Eh(Z), Ev(Z) = E-soil for axial group effect  
   34----   0.5     POSAVR    Soil average Poisson's ratio for group effects              
   35----                                                                                 
   36----  ****************** SOIL SURFACE AND GROUND WATER SECTION                       
   37----   0.000    ZSURF     Z-level of non-scoured soil surface                        
   38----   0.00    SCRGEN    Depth of general scour below 'ZSURF'                        
   39----   0.00    SCRLOC    Depth of local scour below 'ZSURF'                          
   40----   20    SLOPE     Side slope (degrees) of local scour holes                     
   41----   0.000    ZGRWT     Z-level of ground water table                              
   42----   10      GAMPWP    Unit weight of ground water (used to find pore water prss)  
   43----                                                                                 
   44----  ****************** LOADS AT SOIL SURFACE SECTION                               
   45----     0.0   SIGSRF    Vertical stress at surface                                  
   46----     0.0   DPEMB     Vertical stress under embankment loading                    
   47----     0.0   AEMB      Width 'A' of embankment sloping part                        
   48----     0.0   BEMB      Pile position w.r.t. embankment toe (positive outside)      
   49----     0.0   DPCIRC    Vertical stress under circular loaded area                  
   50----     0.0   RADIUS    Radius of circular loaded area (pile is in centre)          
   51----       0   NUMFRC    Number of vertical point forces at soil surface (max is 45) 
   52----            0        Point force values                                          
   53----            0.0      Horizontal distance to pile axis                            
